---
import LegalShell from '../components/LegalShell.astro';
---
<LegalShell
  title="Privacy policy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  updated="September 1, 2026"
  description="How HatePDF handles documents, device preferences and basic website connection information."
>
  <div class="callout"><strong>In short</strong><p>HatePDF's live document tools process your files in your browser. We do not receive, store, analyse or sell the contents of those documents.</p></div>

  <h2>Documents you choose</h2>
  <p>For tools marked as running on your device, the selected file, filename and finished result remain in your browser. HatePDF does not create an account or keep a server copy of those documents. Unsaved work can be lost when you close the tab, clear site data or leave the page.</p>

  <h2>Public web-page conversion</h2>
  <p>If a web-page-to-PDF feature is available and you use it, the public URL you enter must be sent to a server so that page can be retrieved. Do not enter a private, authenticated or confidential address. Your own PDF documents are not involved in that request.</p>

  <h2>Cookies, analytics and advertising</h2>
  <p>HatePDF does not currently use cookies, advertising trackers, analytics profiles, browser fingerprinting or cross-site tracking. We do not sell personal information or count which tools you use.</p>

  <h2>Preferences saved on your device</h2>
  <p>If you choose a colour theme, preview size or favourite tools, that preference can be saved on your device for up to 12 months. When you continue a PDF into another local tool, the temporary handoff is removed after it is used and abandoned handoffs expire after one hour. These items are not used for advertising or profiling.</p>

  <div class="data-controls">
    <div><strong>Clear HatePDF data on this device</strong><p>Removes saved appearance and favourite preferences plus any unclaimed local workflow file.</p></div>
    <button type="button" data-clear-project-data>Clear site data</button>
    <p class="data-controls__status" data-clear-project-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Website hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted by GitHub Pages. GitHub may receive ordinary connection information, such as your IP address, requested page, browser headers and access time, when it delivers the website. That request does not include the contents of a document you selected for a local tool. <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a> explains its processing.</p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>If you follow a link to another website, that site's privacy policy applies. HatePDF does not control external services.</p>

  <h2>Children and sensitive information</h2>
  <p>The service is not directed to children and is not a regulated document repository. Do not post a confidential document, password or personal information in a public support report.</p>

  <h2>Questions and changes</h2>
  <p>Privacy questions can be submitted through the public <a href="https://github.com/Bansi1701/ProjectPDF/issues">GitHub issue tracker</a>. Do not attach sensitive material. We will update the date above when this policy changes materially.</p>
</LegalShell>

<script>
  import { clearPreferences } from '../lib/browserPreferences';
  import { clearHandoffs } from '../lib/handoff';

  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-clear-project-data]');
  const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-clear-project-status]');
  button?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    button.disabled = true;
    if (status) status.textContent = 'Clearing local HatePDF data…';
    clearPreferences();
    try {
      await clearHandoffs();
      document.documentElement.dataset.theme = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light';
      window.dispatchEvent(new Event('projectpdf:preferences-cleared'));
      if (status) status.textContent = 'HatePDF preferences and temporary handoffs were cleared from this browser.';
    } catch (error) {
      if (status) status.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Temporary handoffs could not be cleared. Close other HatePDF tabs and try again.';
    } finally {
      button.disabled = false;
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .data-controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem 1.25rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 1.1rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--paper-raised); }
  .data-controls strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .data-controls p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0; }
  .data-controls button { min-height: 2.75rem; padding: 0 1rem; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, var(--line)); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--accent); color: white; font: 700 var(--step--1)/1 var(--font-sans); cursor: pointer; }
  .data-controls button:hover { background: var(--accent-strong); }
  .data-controls button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 25%, transparent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .data-controls button:disabled { cursor: wait; opacity: 0.65; }
  .data-controls__status { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 1.5em; color: var(--ink-2); font-size: var(--step--1); }
  @media (max-width: 38rem) { .data-controls { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .data-controls button { width: 100%; } }
</style>
